'''Difficulty:''' ★★★★☆

'''Battle:''' Stall Sathankhamun at the enemy base with Manic Mohawk Cats until Nimoy Bore spawns. Then, lure him to the base and swiftly kill him with Awakened Bahamut Cat whilst keeping him weakened with Prof. Cat Jobs. When he dies, send out a few Manic Mohawk Cats to bait out an attack from Sathankhamun, as this will hopefully allow Bahamut to chain two hits on him before dying with the help of the Thunderbolt cannon. From this point onwards, it's just chipping the enemies down with Boulders, Can Cans, and Manic Macho Legs. Save your Thunderbolt for when Bahamut goes off cooldown, since you can get two hits on the enemies if you're lucky. Sniper the Cat helps especially with clearing peons and pushing back the main threats on occasion. Once Sathankhamun's supports die, continue cycling Bahamuts on him until he dies. There is a soft-time limit for getting rid of him, however, so try and kill Sathankhamun before Nimoy Bore spawns or else it'll become impossible to take on both of them at the same time.

