'''Difficulty:''' ★★★☆☆

'''Battle:''' Stall Sathankhamun at the enemy base with Riceball Cats until Nimoy Bore spawns. Then, lure him to the base and swiftly kill him with Chill Cats en masse—do this while getting out Esoteric Uril. The Cat Combos aid Uril and Cat Cactus tremendously, allowing them to tank a lot more punishment from Mr. Puffington and Sathankhamun. Uril will be hardcarrying a majority of the damage alongside Fishman Cat. Your defense is solid enough to where you can semi-comfortably start cycling out Esoteric Urils to slowly chip down Mr. Puffington. The real trouble comes with Chickful A, as not only does she kill both of your meatshields in one hit, but she's more than capable of facetanking Uril. Success depends entirely on whether you can protect each individual Uril well enough from this heavenly hellspawn until she dies, which is what Iron Wall is specifically here for. Remember to always keep enough capital on hand to spawn the next Esoteric Uril.

