'''Difficulty:''' ★★★★★

'''Battle:''' Stall Sathankhamun at the enemy base with Cone Cats until Nimoy Bore spawns. Then, lure him to the base and swiftly kill him with Catellites, Neo Saw Cats, and Bargain Cats. With a small Defense Up Cat Combo, Cone Cat is able to tank a hit from every enemy here, but their cooldown is a massive limiting factor, so Catellite and Neo Saw Cat are their plus ones. To win, you have to get Idi:N2 to directly attack Mr. Puffington either once or twice. Quite frankly, your meatshields are the biggest liability to that end, as Cone Cat, Catellite, and Neo Saw Cat repeatedly knock back Mr. Puffington and make it unnecessarily difficult to get a clear shot. Cone Cat is the biggest offender here, so whenever you want to go for it, stop sending him out and try to get Mr. Puffington to advance ever-so-slightly in order to nuke him. If you can get two Idi:N2 hits off on him, he's dead on the spot, otherwise you have to finish the job with Bargain Cat and Bullet Train Cat while holding as much ground as possible.

You will be fighting dangerously close to the Cat Base by the time Mr. Puffington dies. When Idi:N2 recharges, use her to get valuable burst damage on Chickful A, but wait until she's just rebounded so that Idi can potentially get two attacks on her. Once it's just Sathankhamun on his own, Bargain and Bullet Train Cat sweep relatively easily. Don't let up just yet, though, as the anti-cheese can potentially kill you if the Chickful As start stacking with Nimoy Bore and Mr. Puffington.

