==Trivia==
*Rashōmon is the name of a [[wikipedia:Rajōmon|fallen gate]], a [[wikipedia:Rashōmon (Noh play)|Noh play]], a [[wikipedia:Rashōmon (short story)|short story]] by [[wikipedia:Ryūnosuke Akutagawa|Ryūnosuke Akutagawa]] and a [[wikipedia:Rashomon|film]] by [[wikipedia:Akira Kurosawa|Akira Kurosawa]]. If it refers to the gate, [[Sathankhamun VIII]] could represent [[wikipedia:Rashōmon no oni|Rashōmon no oni]], an ''[[wikipedia:Oni|oni]]'' (a type of demon-like ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'') said to have lived there. Sathankhamun VIII is a variant of [[Hannya]], whose Japanese description refers to her as an ''oni''.
*There is a mistake on the English event poster, where it says you need to beat [[Clionel Dominant]], when in reality you need to beat [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku]] instead.

